00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:40,280
所以我得抛下我孩子  回到工作岗位
Oh, so I have to abandon my children and go back to work,

176
00:07:40,290 --> 00:07:42,770
然后你在家跟孩子们建立感情吗
while you get to stay home and bond with them?

177
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:46,200
可是你才说你不想留在家啊
You just said you didn't want to.

178
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:50,660
不  我不想要被迫要  但如果我想要  我就能要
No, I don't want to have to, but if I want to, I should get to.

179
00:07:52,850 --> 00:07:54,360
那你想要吗
Do you want to?

180
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:56,550
或许有呢
Maybe I do.

181
00:07:56,550 --> 00:07:58,080
那如果我也想要呢
What if I also want to?

182
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:01,130
我不知道啊  我们不能都留在家吧
Well, I don't know, we can't both stay home.

183
00:08:01,130 --> 00:08:03,170
你不觉得该由你回去工作吗
Don't you think you should go back to work,

184
00:08:03,170 --> 00:08:05,070
因为你赚的钱比我多啊
because you make more money?

185
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:07,400
那你不觉得你应该多挣点钱吗
Don't you think you should make more money?

186
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,360
我觉得你这样很性别歧视啊
I think it's pretty sexist of you to say

187
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:13,180
觉得当爸爸的就不能在家带小孩
a dad can't stay home with his children.

188
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:15,630
你知道还有什么很性别歧视吗  忍着[吸"鸟"]
You know what else is sexist, the phrase "Suck it,"

189
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:17,450
但就是这样
yet, here we are.

190
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:23,220
真没想到莱纳德会骗我
I can't believe Leonard lied to me.

191
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:24,780
接下来还会发现他说过什么谎
What are we gonna find out next,

192
00:08:24,780 --> 00:08:27,660
他其实没有乳糖不耐症吗
that he's not really lactose intolerant, hmm?

193
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:31,410
他不是放屁  只是跟隐形的小号手是好朋友
He's just friends with an invisible trumpet player?

194
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:36,150
我知道你不高兴  但如果我们想订那俱乐部
I know you're upset, but if we want to book the Athenaeum,

195
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:38,610
我们现在就得订  然后我跟你保证
we really should do it now, and then, I promise,

196
00:08:38,610 --> 00:08:41,730
我们会有余生让你慢慢抱怨莱纳德
we'll have our whole lives to complain about Leonard.

197
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:46,250
某人先开始说结婚誓词啦
Aw, somebody got a head start on her vows.

198
00:08:47,490 --> 00:08:48,540
那我们达成共识了吗
So do we agree?

199
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:49,980
我们要在那里举行仪式吗
Do we want to get married there?

200
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:51,460
我不知道了
I don't know.

201
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:53,150
爱因斯坦曾是会员
I mean, Einstein was a member.

202
00:08:53,150 --> 00:08:54,290
我喜欢这点
I like that.

203
00:08:54,290 --> 00:08:55,190
你懂吧  可是...
You know? But...

204
00:08:55,190 --> 00:08:59,300
但莱纳德也是会员  真的让我"炒鸡不爽"
Leonard's a member, and that really steams my clams.

205
00:08:59,850 --> 00:09:01,090
我就喜欢你用地方方言的时候
Oh, I love it when you're folksy.

206
00:09:01,090 --> 00:09:02,910
我就直接打电话订了
I'm just gonna call.

207
00:09:03,110 --> 00:09:06,170
而另一方面呢  在莱纳德背叛我们的地方
On the other hand, shaming Leonard during our wedding

208
00:09:06,170 --> 00:09:07,920
结婚并羞辱他
at the very place he betrayed me

209
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:11,080
感觉也十分的美妙
does have a beautiful symmetry to it.

210
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:16,050
不错  那会是你以人夫身份做的首件小肚鸡肠事
That's nice, it'll be your first petty act as a married man.

211
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:19,100
你好  是凯瑟琳吗
Uh-- oh, hi, Kathleen?

212
00:09:19,110 --> 00:09:21,310
我是早先去你那里的艾米
Yeah, this is Amy from earlier.

213
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:24,300
我想先跟你预定5月12号那天的场地
I'd like to go ahead and reserve May 12.

214
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:26,160
不过那也是我们的大喜之日
Although, it is our wedding.

215
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:29,400
或许不该把重心都放在复仇上
I-- maybe it shouldn't be all about revenge.

216
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,580
好的
Oh, I see.

217
00:09:32,580 --> 00:09:35,250
行  谢谢你
Okay, t-thanks.

218
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,990
有人订走了我们的日子
Someone booked our date.

219
00:09:38,990 --> 00:09:40,800
什么
Uh... What?

220
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,130
谁
Who?

221
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:45,230
哎哟哟
Well, well, well.

222
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:48,710
这下可真难办了
This is a pickle.

223
00:09:49,590 --> 00:09:50,710
是啊  所以...
Yes, so,

224
00:09:50,710 --> 00:09:53,220
如果你能把你的生日派对移地举办
if you will just move your birthday party

225
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:55,950
那这就最好不过了
to a different location, everything will be fine.

226
00:09:55,950 --> 00:09:58,220
这挺麻烦啊
Ugh, I-it's tricky.

227
00:09:58,220 --> 00:09:59,890
我不想将我的派对改址
I don't want to move my party,

228
00:09:59,890 --> 00:10:01,290
但我也不想帮你忙
but I also don't want to help you--

229
00:10:01,290 --> 00:10:03,710
等等  我没有麻烦啊
oh, wait, I don't have a problem.

230
00:10:06,050 --> 00:10:07,250
不  是我有
No. I do.

231
00:10:07,250 --> 00:10:09,120
是啊  你麻烦大了
Yeah, you do.

232
00:10:16,070 --> 00:10:17,160
早上好
Morning.

233
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,380
你们都去哪儿逛了
Hey, where you been?

234
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:19,790
没去什么特别的地方
Oh, nowhere special.

235
00:10:19,790 --> 00:10:21,620
就是公园  农贸市场
Just the park, the farmer's market,

236
00:10:21,620 --> 00:10:23,130
然后我们上了轻轨金线到唐人街去了
then we hopped on the Gold Line to Chinatown

237
00:10:23,130 --> 00:10:24,750
因为让孩子们感受其他文化
because it's important for the kids

238
00:10:24,750 --> 00:10:26,600
是很重要的
to experience other cultures.

239
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,270
你又做了些什么
What have you been doing?

240
00:10:29,350 --> 00:10:31,140
现在才早上8点  睡觉
It's 8:00 A.M. Sleeping.

241
00:10:31,140 --> 00:10:32,900
孩子们也是
Oh. So are the kids.

242
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:34,710
这一点应该是随你
I guess they take after you.

243
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:40,450
你只是想证明你会做得比我好
You're just trying to prove that you'd do a better job than me.

244
00:10:40,590 --> 00:10:43,050
你刚睡醒就这么机灵啊
You're pretty sharp having just woken up.

245
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:47,340
霍华德  你我都清楚  你无法保持这个状态
Howard, we both know you can't keep up this pace.

246
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:49,650
到今天下午你就会昏睡在沙发上
By this afternoon you're gonna be passed out on the couch

247
00:10:49,650 --> 00:10:52,770
到时我就得照顾三个累坏了的宝宝
and I'm gonna have three exhausted babies to deal with.

248
00:10:52,990 --> 00:10:54,810
才不会  我能应付
Not true. I got this.

249
00:10:54,810 --> 00:10:57,570
事实上  不如你今天请假休息吧
You know, in fact, why don't you take the day off?

250
00:10:57,570 --> 00:11:00,580
好吧  或许我可以跟佩妮吃午餐
Mm, fine. Maybe I'll have lunch with Penny.

251
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:01,640
慢慢来
Take your time.

252
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,950
去做个按摩
Get a massage.

253
00:11:02,950 --> 00:11:06,620
这是你应得的  毕竟你睡了那么多
You deserve it after all the sleep you've been getting.

254
00:11:09,380 --> 00:11:11,470
也许巴里会改变主意
Maybe Barry will change his mind.

255
00:11:11,470 --> 00:11:13,250
我深表怀疑
Hmm? Oh, I doubt it.

256
00:11:13,250 --> 00:11:16,340
我对他的工作成果说了一些很不公道的话
I said some pretty unprofessional things about his work.

257
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:18,880
可能连"S"[屎]开头的词都用上了
I may have even used the "S" word.

258
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:22,180
"水"准以下吗
Subpar?

259
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:26,200
我不自豪  但我也是有脾气的
I'm not proud of it, Amy, but I have a temper.

260
00:11:26,850 --> 00:11:29,310
其实我们也可以选别的日子
Well, I suppose we could pick a different date.

261
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,400
你可是花了九个月才选中那一天
Well, it took you nine months to choose that one.

262
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:33,860
我不如重选个老公算了
I'll pick a different husband first.

263
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:40,300
我想为雅典娜学术俱乐部的事道歉
Hey, I-I just, I wanted to apologize about the Athenaeum.

264
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:41,510
你之前为什么骗我
Why did you lie to me?

265
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:42,550
我也不知道
I don't know.

266
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:44,290
一开始是好玩
It just seemed funny at first

267
00:11:44,290 --> 00:11:47,720
随着时间过去  变得更好玩了
and then the longer it went on, funnier it got.

268
00:11:49,820 --> 00:11:51,750
所以  大概就是这个原因
So, yeah, I guess that's why.

269
00:11:53,210 --> 00:11:54,800
这可算不上道歉吧
That's not much of an apology.

270
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:56,750
对  因为他不是真的心怀歉意
Yeah, because he's not really sorry.

271
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:59,570
显然  他想去一个没有我的地方
Obviously, he wanted a place to go where I wouldn't be

272
00:11:59,570 --> 00:12:03,130
全世界的室外这么大  他还觉得不够
and apparently all of outside wasn't enough for him.

273
00:12:03,650 --> 00:12:05,230
别这样  我真的不好受
Come on. I-I do feel bad.

274
00:12:05,230 --> 00:12:07,120
为什么  你最好的朋友伤你心了吗
Why? Did your best friend hurt your feelings?

275
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:07,790
拜托  谢尔顿
Come on-- Sheldon.

276
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:10,370
听着  我现在只有空对付一个混蛋
Look, I only have time to deal with one jerk right now

277
00:12:10,370 --> 00:12:12,520
-那就是巴里·克里普奇  -什么
- and that's Barry Kripke. - What?

278
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:15,020
他在我们婚礼日那天预订了雅典娜学术俱乐部
He has the Athenaeum booked for our wedding date

279
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:15,900
不愿意让给我们
and he won't give it up.

280
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:18,600
没错  所以请你离开  否则我就要生气了
Yeah, so if you could just please leave before I get angry

281
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:21,460
会说出令自己后悔的话来评价你的长相  身高
and say something I will regret about your face, your height,

282
00:12:21,460 --> 00:12:24,360
个人卫生  或是你的科学成果
your personal hygiene or the fact that your science,

283
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:27,470
虽然有一定用途  但缺乏派头
while serviceable, lacks panache.

284
00:12:28,330 --> 00:12:29,560
这其实是你对我成果说过的
That's actually one of the nicest things

285
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,710
最动听的评价了
you've ever said about my work.

286
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:34,450
现在我后悔了  再见
And now I regret it. Good-bye.

287
00:12:39,190 --> 00:12:40,280
你在这儿呢
Hey. There you are.

288
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:42,490
我就想在我们出去吃午餐前
Yeah, I just wanted to stop in and see my office

289
00:12:42,490 --> 00:12:43,630
来我办公室看一眼
before we went to lunch.

290
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:46,060
再过几周  你就回来全职上班了  对吧
Just a few more weeks, you'll be back full-time, huh?

291
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:47,380
是啊
Yeah.

292
00:12:48,390 --> 00:12:50,530
你这可不是开心的语气
Uh-oh. That wasn't a happy "yeah."

293
00:12:50,530 --> 00:12:53,410
是我邀莱纳德去健身房时  勉强答应的语气
That was a "Hey, Leonard, do you want to go to the gym?" yeah.

294
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,550
我一直在想  也许我更想待在家
I've just been thinking that maybe I'd rather

295
00:12:56,550 --> 00:12:59,280
照顾孩子  当个好妈妈
stay home with the kids and be a mom.

296
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,980
这可是重大决定
Wow. That's big.

297
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:02,450
我知道
I know.

298
00:13:02,930 --> 00:13:04,370
罗斯滕科斯基博士
Dr. Rostenkowski.

299
00:13:04,370 --> 00:13:05,730
抱歉  我不知道你回来了
I'm sorry, I didn't know you were back.

300
00:13:05,730 --> 00:13:06,400
不是的
Oh, I'm not.

301
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:08,280
我只是来找佩妮吃午餐
I just came to meet Penny for lunch.

302
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:10,610
需要我为你端咖啡或水来吗
Is there anything I can get you? Coffee? Water?

303
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:12,650
-不用了  我们准备...  -咖啡听起来不错
- No, I think we're just gonna... - Coffee sounds good.

304
00:13:13,780 --> 00:13:15,910
-冷萃  加杏仁奶  -完美
- Cold brew, almond milk? - Perfect.

305
00:13:15,910 --> 00:13:17,910
不用帮我准备了
Nothing-nothing for me.

306
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:20,400
好奇怪
It's weird.

307
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:23,200
我离开这么久  却一点都不怀念这里
I've been away so long I don't miss any of this.

308
00:13:24,700 --> 00:13:25,780
抱歉打扰你了
Sorry to bother you.

309
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:28,110
李博士听说你来了  想问你个事
Dr. Lee heard you were here and had a quick question.

310
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,930
好吧  接通他
Fine. Put him on.

311
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:32,380
杰罗德  最近怎么样
Jerold, what's going on?

312
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:34,680
希望你没有毁了我的研究
Hope you're not screwing up my research.

313
00:13:36,090 --> 00:13:36,890
你正在骑单车吗
You calling from a bike ride?

314
00:13:36,890 --> 00:13:39,080
因为你正在迅速倒骑[气势减弱]
'Cause you're backpedaling hard.

315
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:42,220
好吧  发邮件给我  我这就看看
All right, fine. E-mail it over. I'll take a look.

316
00:13:46,470 --> 00:13:47,900
不好意思  刚说到哪儿了
Oh, sorry. Where were we?

317
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:49,590
很爱你的孩子们  不想念工作
Love your kids. Don't miss your job.

318
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,260
对  对
Right, right.

319
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,800
世间万物都无法与之相比
There's nothing in the world

320
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,550
抱着自己熟睡的宝宝
like holding your sleeping baby,

321
00:13:55,550 --> 00:13:57,490
知道你让他感到安全
knowing you make him feel safe and then--

322
00:13:57,490 --> 00:14:00,390
太好了  你拿我爱吃的曲奇饼来了
Oh, good, you got the little cookies I like.

323
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:01,660
我也想吃曲奇饼
I wouldn't mind a cookie.

324
00:14:01,660 --> 00:14:03,480
他已经走了  好吧
And he's gone. Okay.

325
00:14:12,570 --> 00:14:13,460
克里普奇
Hey, Kripke.

326
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:15,380
你好  霍夫斯塔德
Hello, Hofstadter.

327
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:18,030
你怎么亲自在清洗这个
Why are you cleaning that out yourself?

328
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:19,660
没有研究生帮你吗
Don't you have grad students?

329
00:14:19,660 --> 00:14:23,750
拜托  总不能所有脏活都让研究生干
Come on, I can't make my grad students do every dirty job

330
00:14:23,790 --> 00:14:29,030
应该说人力资源部门主管明文禁止我这么做
or so I've been told in writing by the head of Human Resources.

331
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,400
好吧  听我说
Fair enough. Uh, so, look,

332
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:34,050
我是来请求你把雅典娜学术俱乐部
I'm here to ask you to give Sheldon and Amy

333
00:14:34,060 --> 00:14:36,260
让给谢尔顿和艾米举行婚礼
the Athenaeum for their wedding.

334
00:14:38,190 --> 00:14:39,980
我为什么要这么做
Why would I do that?

335
00:14:41,290 --> 00:14:45,850
因为内心深处  你是一个很好的人
Because deep down, Barry, you're a really good guy.

336
00:14:46,470 --> 00:14:48,370
但我真是好人吗
But am I?

337
00:14:51,050 --> 00:14:52,910
好吧  有什么条件
Fine. What's it gonna take?

338
00:14:58,610 --> 00:15:01,230
巴里  我来再问你一次...
Barry, I've come to ask one more...

339
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:02,400
莱纳德
Leonard?

340
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:04,670
你怎么在干这个
Wh-Why are you doing that?

341
00:15:04,670 --> 00:15:07,930
因为巴里在内心深处并不是个好人
Because deep down Barry is not a good guy.

342
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:12,480
他叫你清洗装辐照油脂的桶吗
He's making you clean out barrels of irradiated grease?

343
00:15:12,490 --> 00:15:14,020
是的
Yeah.

344
00:15:15,270 --> 00:15:16,840
我跟他做了笔交易
I made a deal with him

345
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:20,250
让他把雅典娜学术俱乐部让给你举办婚礼
to get you the Athenaeum for your wedding.

346
00:15:20,750 --> 00:15:22,870
你为什么要这么做
Why would you do that?

347
00:15:23,470 --> 00:15:26,530
因为我之前骗了你  很混蛋
Because I was a jerk for lying to you before

348
00:15:26,530 --> 00:15:27,680
